                <pb facs="0745" n="609" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg609"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./737:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Geissler</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-04T17:00:00-06:00">December 4, 1929—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>156. Morrison has informed the Legation that the Minister of Fomento today signed
                    a contract granting the Pan American an air transport contract subject to
                    approval by the Assembly and a provisional permit.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geissler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
